  "description_short": "Artisan coffee roastery and café on Leisure Island serving exceptional brews and light meals with lagoon views.",
  "description_long": "Tucked away on Knysna's tranquil Leisure Island, Coffee Craft is a specialty coffee roastery where the aroma of freshly roasted beans greets you at the door. This laid-back café takes its coffee seriously, offering everything from perfectly pulled espressos to pour-overs that showcase single-origin beans roasted on-site. The space feels relaxed and welcoming, with a mix of indoor seating and outdoor tables where you can watch the occasional heron glide over the lagoon.\n\nBeyond the coffee, expect a menu of fresh breakfasts, homemade pastries, and light lunches that pair well with your brew. The vibe is neighbourhood café meets artisan coffee lab—locals pop in for their morning fix, while visitors linger over a flat white and a slice of something sweet. It's the kind of spot where the baristas know their craft and are happy to chat about bean origins or brewing methods.\n\nLeisure Island's quiet setting makes Coffee Craft feel like a local secret, though the quality of the coffee has earned it a loyal following across Knysna. Whether you're after a quick takeaway or a leisurely breakfast with lagoon breezes, this is where Knysna's coffee lovers gather.",
